<title>GERMANY: BMW details 5-month sales, deliveries.</title>
<headline>BMW details 5-month sales, deliveries.</headline>
<dateline>MUNICH, Germany 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Provisional results for first five months of 1997</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group sales			   24,300  vs 20,700</p>
<p>    Group vehicle deliveries	  497,000 vs 461,800 units</p>
<p>Of which:</p>
<p>    --BMW brand			   288,000 vs 260,700 units</p>
<p>    --Rover brand			 209,000 vs 201,100 units</p>
<p>    BMW motorcycle deliveries	 25,400  vs 25,100 units</p>
<p>    Group workforce (31.3.1997)	    116,256 vs 115,660</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German carmaker is Bayerische Motoren-Werke AG. BMW said the results for the period from January to May, which were released at the carmaker's annual general meeting, were provisional.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
